# Where homelab-energy's metrics.sh writes homelab_energy_*.prom on
# RP-node2, and where node_exporter's textfile collector must read from.
#
# node_exporter flag (RP-node1, if it scrapes RP-node2's node_exporter) or
# RP-node2's own node_exporter, whichever runs the textfile collector:
#   --collector.textfile.directory=/var/lib/node_exporter/textfile_collector
#
# homelab-energy side (config/energy.conf or the environment):
#   METRICS_FILE=/var/lib/node_exporter/textfile_collector/homelab_energy.prom
#
# That directory must exist and be writable by the user running
# bin/homelab-energy (see CLAUDE.md: configuration in /etc/homelab-energy/,
# state in /var/lib/homelab-energy/ — node_exporter's own data dir is
# separate and owned by its own service user).
